          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " sauce is the traditional Caribbean ingredient for colouring the meat. The dark-brown sugar in this recipe performs the same function: caramelise it briefly before adding the oxtail to deepen the colour and add a trace of bittersweet flavour to the sauce."
          }
